{"arxiv_id": "2409.01493v1", "title": "Shrouded Sin Taxes", "normalized_lane": "markets", "verdict": "ADAPT", "doctrine_tag": "BASELINE", "improvement": "Add effective-price accounting to the engine's CLV/edge pipeline as honesty infrastructure (detecting when shrouded fees flip posted +EV picks to effective −EV), and use per-book posted-vs-effective margin gaps as a line-selection feature that preferentially targets slow-moving high-gap books.", "gate": "Adopt effective-price accounting in the engine's CLV/edge pipeline if sign flips occur on ≥2% of positive-EV picks for any tracked book (posted +EV → effective −EV). If flips are <2% across all books, log the discipline as verified-unnecessary and keep posted-price accounting.", "owner": "Mimo", "bucket": "MODEL", "effort": "small", "depends_on": []}
