{"question": "What Is YPRR Allowed vs. Man?", "answer": "YPRR Allowed vs. Man measures the average yards per route run allowed in man coverage. This NFL player stat is a man-coverage NFL advanced stat for per-route performance. In NFL team stats, it helps rank CBs in man schemes."}
